HOUSE RULES

Specific departures from Rules Cyclopedia

- Uses ascending Armor Class. The game uses OSE-style ascending Armor Class, with unarmored AC 10 and higher AC being better.
- Lowest negative modifier from ability scores is -1.
- First-level characters receive maximum HP.
- Calculating CN to map to Weight in pounds to simplify the encumberance system.
- Two-handed weapons receive -2 initiative modifier instead of "loses initiative".